}

{
"explanation": "The response presents extensive Cox's Bazar vs Mae La indicator comparisons using structured tables, bullet lists, and side-by-side formats throughout (e.g., comparative tables in sections 1.1, 2.3, 7.1, 7.2, 11.1, 11.2, 15.1). It does not rely solely on narrative paragraphs; thus the criterion describing 'narrative paragraphs only, with no tables, bullet lists, or structured side-by-side format' is not met.",
"criterion_status": "UNMET"
}

{
"explanation": "The response extensively references UNHCR health information systems, including the UNHCR Health Sector Bulletin (January 2024), UNHCR site reports (Mae La Oon 2018), and UNHCR AR2/AR18 site reports. It also mentions the MPMSR dashboard and DHIS-2 data. This satisfies the criterion of referencing UNHCR iRHIS dashboards, camp-level health data, or UNHCR health surveillance systems.",
